{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f1b01bff-bc84-43df-a95c-4b35049ea5d5",
    "name": "Messages",
    "description": "Coleção de exemplos para a API de Mensagens (NestJS + DynamoDB + Kafka).\n\nFluxo recomendado:\n1. Auth → Login (popula {{accessToken}})\n2. Messages → Create (popula {{messageId}}). Header `Idempotency-Key` sempre presente — UUID novo a cada execução via `{{$guid}}`. Para testar dedup, fixe o valor manualmente e re-execute.\n3. Demais requests usam as variáveis automaticamente.\n\nVariáveis de ambiente:\n- baseUrl (default http://localhost:3000)\n- accessToken (preenchido pelo Login)\n- messageId (preenchido pelo Create)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "26012105"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (stub)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.test('accessToken recebido', () => pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('expiresIn numérico', () => pm.expect(body.expiresIn).to.be.a('number'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"alice\",\n  \"password\": \"demo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /messages (idempotente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Gera UUID e guarda em `currentIdempotencyKey` pra reuso manual em retries.",
                  "// Para testar dedup: fixe o valor da variável `currentIdempotencyKey` e re-execute — id retornado deve ser o mesmo.",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('currentIdempotencyKey')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('currentIdempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const previousId = pm.collectionVariables.get('messageId');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', body.id);",
                  "pm.test('status inicial = enviado', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('enviado'));",
                  "if (previousId) {",
                  "  pm.test('mesma Idempotency-Key → mesmo id (dedup)', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.eql(previousId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{currentIdempotencyKey}}",
                "description": "UUID gerado no pre-request. Reutilizado em retries enquanto a variável não for limpa. Para forçar nova key, apague `currentIdempotencyKey` nas Collection Variables."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Olá, mensagem de teste\",\n  \"sender\": \"alice\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/messages",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "messages"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "/messages/:id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
